1 fight, 2 run: 1
You strike at rat 1. d20 = 6, total 7 vs AC 12: miss.
Rat 1 bites. d20 = 5, total 5 vs AC 15: miss.
Rat 2 bites. d20 = 6, total 6 vs AC 15: miss.
